      "module": "construction",
      "size": "large"
    },
    {
      "id": "os_release",
      "label": "固定 HF 发布：500 条 OS 任务\n实际命令数范围：4–26\n339 条在 9–12 · 161 条在区间外\n论文目标不是硬筛选",
      "type": "database",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "kg_source",
      "label": "来源为 GrailQA\nS-expression · 实体 · 答案\n不是 LLM 生成的任务计划\n保留问题函数分布",
      "type": "database",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "kg_convert",
      "label": "转换为约束动作\n关系 · 邻居 · 交集\n属性 · 最大 · 最小 · 计数\n经 SPARQL 执行",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "kg_gate",
      "label": "KG 候选有效？\n动作转换无错误\nS-expression 执行正确\n实体名称通过发布过滤",
      "type": "decision",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "kg_reject",
      "label": "淘汰 KG 候选\n转换或执行错误",
      "type": "terminal",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "large"
    },
    {
      "id": "kg_release",
      "label": "筛选 396 条 KG 任务\n长度 2–8 各 50 条\n长度 9 为 46 条\n长度 7–9 额外复核",
      "type": "database",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "manual_review",
      "label": "逐环境人工复核\n各随机抽取 10% 任务\n检查语法 · 逻辑 · 实用性\n采用试运行后的配置",
      "type": "user",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "dataset_release",
      "label": "发布 1,396 条任务\nDB 500 · OS 500 · KG 396\n三份公开 Parquet 文件\nHF 展示为 default / train",
      "type": "database",
      "module": "construction",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "framework",
      "label": "配置六个组件\n模型池 · 智能体 · 环境\n历史工厂 · 控制器 · 回调\n本地或透明 RPC 部署",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "sequence",
      "label": "按固定顺序执行任务\n控制器支持断点恢复\n禁止并行任务序列\n随时间累积经验",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "db_eval",
      "label": "数据库运行与评分\n每次实验一个 MySQL 容器 · 每任务建删库\nAction: Operation / Answer · 最多 3 轮\nSELECT 比结果 · 写操作比状态 MD5",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "os_eval",
      "label": "OS 运行与评分\n每任务使用全新 Ubuntu 容器\nAct: bash / Act: finish · 最多 5 轮\n评价器退出码 0 才成功",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "kg_eval",
      "label": "KG 运行与评分\n7 种动作 API · 最多 15 轮\nFinal Answer: 变量 #n\n精确匹配 · F1 · 可执行率",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "success_gate",
      "label": "是否正确完成？\n二元任务奖励",
      "type": "decision",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "large"
    },
    {
      "id": "replay_memory",
      "label": "保存成功轨迹\n近期 FIFO 经验记忆\n失败任务不保存",
      "type": "database",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "replay",
      "label": "比较经验回放\n基线 N = 0\n测试 N：1 · 2 · 4 · 8 · 16 · 32 · 64\n注入近期成功轨迹",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "gsc",
      "label": "原始推理后的可选 GSC\n公开回调仅支持 DB + OS\n原始响应 + 分组候选\n多数投票可替换当前动作",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_infer",
      "label": "生成原始智能体响应\n固定提示 + 当前环境观察\n使用环境专属解析格式\n回调接收这份原始响应",
      "type": "process",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "report",
      "label": "汇报任务成功率\n按 DB · OS · KG 拆分\n技能 · 难度 · 回放深度\n分组 · 输入 Token · OOM",
      "type": "terminal",
      "module": "evaluation",
      "size": "xl"
    }
